[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_00_0010","text":"日花，去便利店了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_00_0020","text":"嗯\n在搞增量活动哦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_00_0030","text":"增量活动……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_00_0040","text":"是的！便当啊零食啊……\n热食小吃也是活动对象！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_00_0005","text":"便当啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_00_0006","text":"零食啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_00_0007","text":"热食小吃啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_01_0010","text":"好，今天就来顿扎实的吧！\n我也去买"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_01_0020","text":"……那，我也去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_02_0010","text":"趁这个机会囤点货吧！\n有点能啃的东西挺好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_02_0020","text":"……注意别吃太多了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_03_0010","text":"热食小吃这种东西，\n总是忍不住想买啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07070000_03_0020","text":"那种东西\n最容易胖了就是了——"}]
